! The face intent plane ~ the record

The plane's law speaks at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/face-intent-plane`>>; its dated rulings stand in that meme's `#/rulings`. This record keeps the build order.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/the-build`>>

!! The build ~ road item `I1`

Item `I1` on the founding road in the kahu workbench carries the build, red-first in this order: the plane and its entry kinds; stand-down and the verb classes; the read-side winner; claims, takeover and causal voids; the face-join summons moving off the daemon doc onto the plane (closing "two hearths of one face"); the daemon wiki's view pane; the rubric's witness; then the far agent's relay seat, item `I2`, built. Item `I3` carries the plane's hardening under re-pin, re-target and growth (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/i2-relay-lane`>>). The CLI's per-invocation face naming (the session model's commit 5) lands beside the summons move, since an intent names its issuing face.

<<~/ahu>>

